## Security model

| Role | `nx_solution` | `nx_demoasset` | Reference tables | `nx_demorequest` | `nx_project` | `nx_projectevidence` |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| Contributor | Create; Read/Write own; Read published | Same as parent | Read; Create on `nx_technology` only | Read own | Create; Read/Write own | Same as parent |
| CSM | Read published only | Read (published parents) | Read | Create; Read own | Read (context on Solution detail) | Read |
| Librarian | Full | Full | Full | Full | Full | Full |

Unpublished `nx_solution` rows stay invisible to CSMs at the platform level. `Publication Status` and `Library Notes` carry field-level security.

